<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BE Semiconductor raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BE Semiconductor raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its rating of BE Semiconductor Industries to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- BE Semiconductor gained 11/16 to 13-1/4 in early morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
